  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think in one of the recent updates, something may have brought this bug back. It was fixed before (see: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/other-players-voices-will-sometimes-cut-out-while-theyre-speaking-but-only-for-y) and while it didn't completely fix the issue, the rate at which it happened was much, much rarer.\n\nRecently though I've noticed it happening way more, at least once or twice every single night whereas after the fix it was only like, once every 4 days or something.\n\nCopy and pasting from old canny: Have you ever had a conversation with a group of people, and while one person is talking, it sounds like he cuts out mid-sentence, yet everyone else in the group can still hear them? It only lasts for about 5-6 seconds, then the voice comes back again. It will happen randomly, and I encounter it happening maybe twice per 3 hour play session usually.",
